## Paved-road contract

This repository is generated from the Golden Path Go HTTP service template. It provides a secure HTTP server baseline, structured JSON logging, liveness/readiness endpoints, Prometheus metrics, unit tests, non-root/distroless container packaging, and a CI pipeline that publishes immutable GHCR images from `main`.

The application team owns business logic, dependency readiness, SLOs, domain-specific telemetry, data migrations, and service-specific incident procedures.

